#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:1722
msgid ""
"In the high-level CIR representation, this operation appears as the first "
"operation in a catch handler region of a `cir.try` operation, taking the "
"region's `!cir.eh_token` argument. In the flattened CIR representation, it "
"appears in a catch block, taking the block's `!cir.eh_token` argument."
