msgid "_CIR longjmp operation_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:5140
msgid ""
"Restore the environment (e.g., stack pointer, instruction pointer, signal "
"mask, and other registers) at the time of setjmp() call, by using the "
"information saved in `env` by setjmp()."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:0
