"`cir.end_cleanup` marks the end of a cleanup block during exception "
"unwinding. It takes the `!cir.cleanup_token` returned by the corresponding "
"`cir.begin_cleanup` operation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:5405
