msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:16349
msgid ""
"Upper bound, in bits, on the language alignment of a vector. This is "
"`TargetInfo::getMaxVectorAlign()`. The language alignment of a vector is its "
"size in bytes rounded up to a power of two, and then at most `max_align` "
"bits. The cap does not apply to the vector's ABI alignment, which is the "
"alignment of the LLVM vector type it lowers to. A target that leaves the "
"maximum at 0 records no entry, and the vector's language alignment equals "
"its ABI alignment."
msgstr ""

