#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:16496
msgid "Syntax: `!cir.cuda_surface`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:16498
msgid ""
"`!cir.cuda_surface` represents a CUDA built-in surface reference in CIR. The "
"type preserves surface semantics at the CIR level and lowers to the NVPTX "
"device-side handle representation (`i64`) during lowering to LLVM IR."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:16503
msgid "CUDADeviceTextureType"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:16505
msgid "_CUDA device texture reference type_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:16507
msgid "Syntax: `!cir.cuda_texture`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:16509
msgid ""
"`!cir.cuda_texture` represents a CUDA built-in texture reference in CIR. The "
"type preserves texture semantics at the CIR level and is lowered to the "
"target device representation during lowering to LLVM IR."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:16514
