"`!cir.catch_token` is an opaque type used to track catch handling state in "
"flattened CIR. It is returned by `cir.begin_catch` and consumed by "
"`cir.end_catch`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:16524
msgid ""
"This token ensures that catch handlers are properly paired and allows the "
"ABI lowering pass to generate appropriate exception catching code."
